---
// Ring arcs rising from the bottom edge: the hill in the corner of the phone menu.
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax slice" aria-hidden="true">
	{[150, 118, 86, 54, 22].map((r) => <circle cx="100" cy="230" r={r} fill="none" stroke="var(--paper)" stroke-width="6" />)}
</svg>

<style>
	svg {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
	}
</style>
